caption: Legacy Isekai Caliber Integration
rule: legacy-isekai-caliber-integration

In an Isekai campaign that still uses Caliber, Prestiging resets Caliber advancement except for one chosen Prestige World. The retained value is a campaign-sheet field, not a rule of the forward GATES framework. New GATES campaigns should not assume Caliber exists.
